  "description": "The Soar 2.0 takes the platform to another level of performance. A truly modern road bike with full carbon frame and fork engineered from Toray T700 carbon fiber. This results in optimal power transfer and impressive comfort whilst maximising weight reduction.\nAdding to the frames top flight ride is front and rear through axles for pinpoint handling accuracy and internal headset / cabling for aerodynamic gains. The Soar is a rapid ride.\nThe Soar 2.0 is equipped with a full Shimano 105 R7000 groupset. Using trickledown design from top flight Dura Ace the hydraulic discs give unprecedented braking power and control with all the modulation you need. The 22 speed gear changes are accurate and effortless with the STI shifters easily in reach if on the hoods or the drops. The compact 50/34t chainset matched to the 11-32t cassette provides great range as well as close matched ratios to keep that cadence consistent. Climbs or sprints this has you covered.",
